 Computer accepts messages.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486773-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486773-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/3/e/3ed6b6f6a06030f371b786e72ff153f0d8af76c0.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/8XTCTjnadNMt53BdlS7TLkLMo0M.png?dl=1\" title=\"Screenshot 2026-09-08 114100.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/e/3ed6b6f6a06030f371b786e72ff153f0d8af76c0_2_690x431.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-08 114100.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"8XTCTjnadNMt53BdlS7TLkLMo0M\" width=\"690\" height=\"431\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/e/3ed6b6f6a06030f371b786e72ff153f0d8af76c0_2_690x431.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/e/3ed6b6f6a06030f371b786e72ff153f0d8af76c0_2_1035x646.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/3/e/3ed6b6f6a06030f371b786e72ff153f0d8af76c0_2_1380x862.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EDEDEE\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eScreenshot 2026-09-08 114100.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2047×1280 434 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-486773-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-486773-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u